        <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconLifebuoy">M12,22 C17.52,22 22,17.52 22,12 C22,6.48 17.52,2 12,2 C6.48,2 2,6.48 2,12 C2,17.52 6.48,22 12,22 Z M12,16 C14.21,16 16,14.21 16,12 C16,9.79 14.21,8 12,8 C9.79,8 8,9.79 8,12 C8,14.21 9.79,16 12,16 Z M4.93,4.93 L9.17,9.17 M14.83,14.83 L19.07,19.07 M14.83,9.17 L19.07,4.93 M4.93,19.07 L9.17,14.83</StreamGeometry>
